- Basic Design: `docs/01-basic-design/`
- Detail Design: `docs/02-detail-design/`
- Backlog & Roadmap: `backlog/`
- Feature Specs: `specs/[epic-id]/`
- Source Code: `src/` (Clean Architecture: Domain, Application, Infrastructure, Presentation, WebApp)
- Test Suites: `tests/` (unit, integration, e2e)

## 3. WORKFLOW COMMANDS
- `/wf-presale`: Run presale proposal & cost estimation.
- `/wf-kickoff`: Run kickoff & basic design.
- `/wf-refactor`: Scan legacy codebase (Read-only) & propose refactoring.
- `/wf-autopilot [epic-id]`: Run full-cycle autonomous development.
- `/wf-hotfix [bug-id]`: Emergency surgical bug fix (Red test -> Zero regression).
- `/wf-delta [cr-id]`: Run spec-first change request flow.
- `/wf-uiux [epic-id]`: Run 5 UX states & Playwright visual QA.
- `/wf-audit`: Run architecture & traceability audit.
